mask_refine.preview_note = Sīghatthāya pubbarūpaṃ khuddakaṃ kataṃ. Pariyantappamāṇāni lekhanassa pixelesu honti; Payojanaṃ paripuṇṇavibhajanaṃ saṃvidahati. Vaḍḍhanaṃ imaṃ pubbarūpaṃ mahantaṃ karoti.
mask_refine.duplicate_note = Niggamo: sodhitapariyantavaṇṇehi paṭicchādakena ca saddhiṃ navasantharaṃ. Mūlasantharaṃ ṭhapitañca paṭicchannañca.
mask_refine.mask_note = Niggamo: pavattasanthare paṭicchādakaṃ. Santharassa pikselā ca etarahigahaṇañca ṭhapīyanti.
mask_refine.no_raster = Tassa paṭicchādakaṃ parisodhetuṃ pikselasantharaṃ gaṇhatha.
