mask_refine.no_mask = Paṭhamaṃ gahaṇaṃ karotha vā santharapaṭicchādakaṃ pakkhipatha.
mask_refine.changed = Lekhanaṃ vipariṇataṃ. Paṭicchādakaparisodhanaṃ pidahitvā puna vivaratha.
mask_refine.rgb_only = Vaṇṇapariveṇānaṃ apagamanaṃ RGB-santharesu upalabbhati. Imasmiṃ vaṇṇavidhāne paṭicchādakaparisodhanaṃ pavattati.
mask_refine.too_large = Paṭicchādakaṃ khemasatipamāṇaṃ atikkamati. Khuddakataraṃ lekhanaṃ vā gahaṇaṃ vā payojetha.
mask_refine.processing = Paripuṇṇavibhajanapaṭicchādakaṃ parisodhīyati… Lekhanaṃ avipariṇāmetvā paṭikkhipituṃ sakkā.
